      "cooked": "<p>So, I'm starting to play around with this, and running into a small issue.&nbsp; I love the suggestion from&nbsp;<a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/starter-kit-gamemaster-pro-tip-use-index-cards-11031\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">twoeyedjack</a>&nbsp;that GMs make use of index cards to track objectives, and I'm wanting to make active use of that.&nbsp; However, I'm not sure what the best way to run a game online using this system would be.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What do people think the best application to use for such a direction is?</p>",
